---

## Core Principles

### Human-Final Authority

AI supports decision-making.

Humans remain responsible for final decisions.

### Explainability

Every assessment should be understandable.

### Auditability

Every decision should be reviewable.

### Replayability

Historical decisions should be reconstructable.

### Governance-First

Governance is designed into the system from the beginning.

---

## Why It Matters

The future of financial AI is not only about intelligence.

It is about trust.

AXION helps transform credit decisions into explainable, evidence-based, and human-governed financial intelligence.

